# Text is stored and checked out with LF, as .editorconfig asks, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Configs must also stay UTF-8 without a byte-order mark: git does not enforce that, `RtpsTool validate` does.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Copies of game logs kept as evidence: stored exactly as the game wrote them.
*.log -text

# Binaries: never converted or diffed as text.
*.dll binary
*.dds binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mu binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
